WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.900
Meet TabPare. Smart Organize groups
related tabs in one click.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.800
Duplicate cleanup keeps only
the copies you need.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Choose Sleep to free memory, or Close
to remove inactive tabs.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Optional automation clears duplicates
on your schedule.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.800
Protect important sites.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.500
After cleanup, Undo restores closed tabs,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500
and Retry handles anything left.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.800
Simple, private tab control,
right inside Chrome.
